{"id":"ff113b4d11bbe470","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-jsj-decomposition.md","title":"JSJ Decomposition","display":"df-jsj-decomposition — JSJ Decomposition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-jsj-decomposition","aliases":["58-df-jsj-decomposition"],"display":"df-jsj-decomposition — JSJ Decomposition","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-torus-decomposition.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-jsj-decomposition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-jsj-decomposition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-jsj-decomposition — JSJ Decomposition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a4901c0343d9dbe4\" href=\"?note=a4901c0343d9dbe4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-torus-decomposition.md\">../batch18/58-df-torus-decomposition.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> (compact orientable irreducible three-manifold) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathcal T\\)</span> (candidate torus family)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TorusDecomposition}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TorusDecomposition}_S\\)</span> (torus-decomposition predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a4901c0343d9dbe4\" href=\"?note=a4901c0343d9dbe4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-torus-decomposition.md\">../batch18/58-df-torus-decomposition.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{JSJDecomposition}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{JSJDecomposition}_S\\)</span> (JSJ predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_M,\\mathcal P\\in V\">\\(\\tau_M,\\mathcal P\\in V\\)</span> 是在断言中量化的拓扑与补集连通分支族；上游谓词参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal P)\">\\((M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal P)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jsj\\text{-}decomposition} \\vdash \\operatorname{JSJDecomposition}_S(M,\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow \\exists\\tau_M,\\mathcal P\\in V\\;\\mathrm{TorusDecomposition}_S(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jsj\\text{-}decomposition} \\vdash \\operatorname{JSJDecomposition}_S(M,\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow \\exists\\tau_M,\\mathcal P\\in V\\;\\mathrm{TorusDecomposition}_S(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本文件保留原定义的环面切割投影，不额外加入不可压缩性、极小性或唯一性。因此，本谓词的名称不表示已经加入标准 JSJ 分解的全部条件。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-torus-decomposition.md","status":"resolved","id":"a4901c0343d9dbe4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-torus-decomposition.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-torus-decomposition.md","status":"resolved","id":"a4901c0343d9dbe4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TorusDecomposition}_S$ (torus-decomposition predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-torus-decomposition.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TorusDecomposition}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{JSJDecomposition}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_M,\\mathcal P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jsj\\text{-}decomposition} \\vdash \\operatorname{JSJDecomposition}_S(M,\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow \\exists\\tau_M,\\mathcal P\\in V\\;\\mathrm{TorusDecomposition}_S(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal P)","display":true}],"bytes":1169,"backlinks":[{"id":"f8cdda6985c34f12","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-724","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-jsj-decomposition.md|58-df-jsj-decomposition]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["a4901c0343d9dbe4"]}